%% 10 Immutable corpus publish
flowchart TB
  Local[(Local corpus<br/>MySQL + uploads + Qdrant)]
  Dry[npm run corpus:publish -- --dry-run]
  Read[Đọc MySQL/Qdrant/uploads; không mutate]
  Guard[Kiểm consistency, path, secret, privacy và target]
  Plan[Redacted plan + provisional identity]
  Review[Operator review PII/secret/quyền/scope]

  Local --> Read
  Dry --> Read --> Guard --> Plan --> Review

  Publish[npm run corpus:publish -- --confirm-reviewed]
  Freeze[Pause app/Python writers]
  Export[Export scoped MySQL + exact originals + Qdrant snapshot]
  Verify{Cross-store, checksum, manifest và private-target guard PASS?}
  Identity[Build content-v2 release identity]
  Existing{Immutable objects đã tồn tại?}
  Upload[Create-only upload; manifest last]
  ReadBack[Download/read-back verify]
  Pointer[Update bootstrap/corpus-release.json]
  Success[CORPUS_PUBLISH_OK]
  Fail[Fail; pointer cũ giữ nguyên]
  Finally[Resume writers; cleanup normal staging]

  Review --> Publish --> Freeze --> Export --> Verify
  Verify -->|Không| Fail --> Finally
  Verify -->|Có| Identity --> Existing
  Existing -->|Absent| Upload --> ReadBack
  Existing -->|Same content| ReadBack
  Existing -->|Collision| Fail
  ReadBack -->|Fail| Fail
  ReadBack -->|PASS| Pointer --> Success --> Finally

  Note1[Dry-run không stop writer, snapshot, staging, upload hay đổi pointer]
  Note2[Release không chứa code, container, secret, auth token, log hoặc cache]
  Note3[Coordinated verification/recovery; không phải distributed transaction]
  Note4[SIGINT/SIGTERM resume best-effort; signal-time staging cleanup chưa bảo đảm]
